{"availability":"available","full":"renshuBTC/URPD-History","name":"URPD-History","description":"BitcoinURPD.com — every bitcoin by the price it last moved at, daily since 2009. Scrub through history by dragging the dot or with the arrow keys, or watch the full-history videos. Coloured by short- and long-term holders or coin age. Explainer in English, Chinese and Japanese. Data from Bitcoin Research Kit.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-19T14:31:17Z","updated":"2026-10-08T14:26:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://BitcoinURPD.com","topics":["bitcoin","cost-basis","data-visualization","long-term-holders","on-chain-analysis","realized-price","urpd","utxo"],"demo":"https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:29.074Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:29.074Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:29.074Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:01.397Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:32.703Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:29.074Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The Bitcoin URPD (UTXO Realized Price Distribution) sorts every bitcoin by the price at which it last moved on-chain and adds up the supply at each price. BitcoinURPD.com draws it for every day since 2009-01-03, each bar split into short- and long-term holders (LTH/STH, at 150 days) or into 23 age bands, with the left axis fitted to each day's own bars. It is a cost-basis distribution of the whole bitcoin supply: a tall bar is a price where a lot of supply last moved, a gap is a price where almost none did, and the price box gives the share of the day's value (or coins) in profit and in loss…","LTH/STH or AGE), opened by the video buttons in the toolbar; see How it works."],"features":["Scrub through history: drag the orange dot along the price line, or use ← / → (step size 1D / 1W / 1M /"